Verification: going backward from the 6 cookies left, the third friend took 5 (so 6 + 5 = 11), the second friend took 5 (so 11 + 5 = 16), the first friend took 3 (so 16 + 3 = 19), the brother took 1 (so 19 + 1 = 20), and Kristy ate 2 (so 20 + 2 = 22). That matches, confirming the answer.

So Kristy baked 22 cookies.

